[hr][/hr]

[h2]Game Rules[/h2]

[list]
[*] [b]C&C: France — Lowlands Containment[/b] (default: on) — France's Lowlands neighbors start with elevated antagonism, decaying over 200 years
[*] [b]C&C: Wealth Hoarding Events[/b] (default: on) — countries hoarding gold above 100× monthly income face court pressure events
[*] [b]C&C: Mamluks — Foreign Rule Strain[/b] (default: on) — Mamluks begin with peasant levy penalty and decaying military strain
[*] [b]C&C: Ottomans — Colonization[/b] (default: prevent) — Ottomans permanently blocked from colonizing overseas
[/list]

[hr][/hr]

[h2]Country Starting Modifiers[/h2]

[list]
[*] [b]France[/b] — elevated Lowlands antagonism + permanent expansionist modifier, both decaying over 200 years
[*] [b]Mamluks[/b] — permanent peasant levy penalty + severe military strain modifier decaying over 200 years
[*] [b]Ottomans[/b] — permanently prevented from colonizing overseas
[/list]

